    "failure_scenario": "Same trio (or subset) re-declared in api/routes/crew.py:132-136, api/routes/match.py:80, and api/routes/assignment.py:86-97, even though api/errors.py already exists as the canonical place for HTTP error shaping (FR-20). If the error envelope shape changes (e.g. adding an error code field alongside `detail`), it has to be edited in 4 places instead of one shared `not_found()/forbidden()/conflict()` in api/errors.py — a missed file returns the old shape and breaks any client/tests relying on the new one."
  },
  {
    "file": "services/assignment.py",
